  "description": "Launcher and window manager for terminal windows - built for juggling many Claude Code sessions, usable for any shell.",
  "keywords": ["electron", "window-manager", "claude-code", "terminal", "mintty", "git-bash", "taskbar", "tray", "windows", "session-manager"],
